OL,3,AEngland up in reading, maths and
OL,4,Ascience rankings as Scotland and Wales
OL,5,Afall behind
OL,6,
OL,7,FEnglish pupils have pulled ahead of the
OL,8,Frest of the UK in international
OL,9,Freading, maths and science tests, new
OL,10,Fdata suggests, with Scotland and Wales
OL,11,Ffalling further behind.
OL,13,FThe 2025 Programme for International
OL,14,FStudent Assessment (Pisa) saw reading
OL,15,Fand maths scores slump in each UK
OL,16,Fnation except England, while all four
OL,17,Fsaw an uptick in science, with that
OL,18,Frise again most notable in England.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
