OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEngland up in reading, maths and
OL,4,Ascience rankings as Scotland and Wales
OL,5,Afall behind
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe latest Pisa report, which is
OL,8,Fpublished every three years, also
OL,9,Fwarned of a worldwide decline in
OL,10,Fteenagers' reading skills.
OL,12,FTeenagers were losing the skills that
OL,13,F"matter most in the age of AI", such as
OL,14,Fbeing able to critically evaluate
OL,15,Finformation from different sources, it
OL,16,Fsaid.
